            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/709380/extras/f6491789c84a1b0c9177b9926cdd243c.avif?t=1784075151\" width=502 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circularity: Minimalistic Adventure</strong> is a puzzle game built around simple controls and increasingly challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is to guide your character to the exit portal to reach the next stage. Move in straight lines, avoid obstacles, travel through portals, ricochet off walls, and find the correct path to the goal. The more stars you earn, the more levels you unlock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzle gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 challenging levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of obstacles and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stars to unlock additional levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements.</p></li></ul>",
